The SVGs under material/ are the file and folder icons of Material Icon Theme
(https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme), copied unchanged by
script/generate-file-icons.mjs, which also writes the name-to-icon tables in
crates/condr-gui/src/app/file_icons/generated.rs from the theme's own mapping source.
The default material/file.svg and material/folder.svg are drawn by that script from the
paths the theme's build draws them from. The theme version and commit are recorded at the
top of generated.rs.

